Changes made in this fork:
  - Java package renamed from com.aveeopen to com.hamo.styrixviz
  - applicationId set to com.hamo.styrixviz, version reset to 1.0.0 (versionCode 1)
  - App name changed to "Styrix Viz"
  - Launcher and status bar icons replaced with new artwork
  - Advertising removed (Google Play Services Ads dependency, AdView layouts, AdsDesign class)
  - Guava dependency removed (ConcurrentWeakHashMap now uses only the JDK)
  - JUnit dependency removed (small in-app Assert helper added)
  - Migrated from the Android support libraries to AndroidX
  - Build files rewritten for Gradle 9.6.1 / Android Gradle Plugin 9.3.1 (namespace, compileSdk 36, minSdk 21)
  - switch statement on R.id values in MainActivity rewritten as if/else
  - Prebuilt original app-release.apk removed from the source tree
  - IDE project metadata removed
  - README rewritten
  Source files carrying the original copyright header have a "Modified for Styrix Viz" line added.

